  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/06/IMG_0951.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>A mediod&iacute;a de este s&aacute;bado se han clausurado en l&#39;Ol&iacute;mpic los XXX Juegos Escolares Deportivos de Onda, que desde hace dos cursos incluyen el multideporte y est&aacute;n organizados por el Ayuntamiento, la Caja Rural y la asociaciones de madres y padres de alumnos (AMPA).</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cloendajocsescolarsesportius13/img_0902.jpg\" alt=\"img_0902\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cloendajocsescolarsesportius13/img_0903.jpg\" alt=\"img_0903\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cloendajocsescolarsesportius13/img_0904.jpg\" alt=\"img_0904\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cloendajocsescolarsesportius13/img_0905.jpg\" alt=\"img_0905\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cloendajocsescolarsesportius13/img_0906.jpg\" alt=\"img_0906\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cloendajocsescolarsesportius13/img_0907.jpg\" alt=\"img_0907\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cloendajocsescolarsesportius13/img_0908.jpg\" alt=\"img_0908\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cloendajocsescolarsesportius13/img_0909.jpg\" alt=\"img_0909\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cloendajocsescolarsesportius13/img_0910.jpg\" alt=\"img_091